A heading's marker separator is a run, and none of it is content

```
##  h

###   a b
.
<section id="h">
  <h2>h</h2>
  <section id="a-b">
    <h3>a b</h3>
  </section>
</section>
```

```
#  Sec

See </#Sec>.
.
<section id="Sec">
  <h1>Sec</h1>
  <p>See <a href="#Sec">Sec</a>.</p>
</section>
```

```
## 	x
.
<section id="x">
  <h2>	x</h2>
</section>
```
